[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Processing runs as a Linux binary via FreeBSD's Linux emulation layer.

Make sure the Linuxulator is enabled (the linux(4) and linux64(4)
kernel modules are loaded automatically on demand) and that linprocfs
and linsysfs are mounted, which the linux_base-rl9 package sets up:

	# service linux start

On systems without NVIDIA graphics, OpenGL sketches render through
the Mesa software rasterizer of the Linux userland, which is slower
than native OpenGL.  The serial library expects Linux device names
such as /dev/ttyUSB0; symlink your FreeBSD serial devices if needed.
EOM
}
]
